  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1701.01 Agreement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1701.01 Agreement. Under the authority provided by RSA 260:73, the “International Registration Plan” approved by International Registration Plan, Inc., on January 1, 2022, available as noted in Appendix A, provides for registration reciprocity among member jurisdictions.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 1700) #13379, EXEMPT, eff 5-23-22",
